{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17332","headline":"杂言赋得风送崔秀才归白田限三五六七言 · 权德舆","name":"杂言赋得风送崔秀才归白田限三五六七言","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"响深涧，思啼猨。\n闇入苹洲暖，轻随柳陌暄。\n澹荡乍飘云影，芳菲徧满花源。\n寂寞春江别君处，和烟带雨送征轩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17332.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17332","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}